  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div><ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Chọn hệ tọa độ như hình bên.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Phương trình elip là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>64</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Tính khoảng cách theo phương thẳng đứng từ một điểm cách chân tường <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>5</mn></semantics></math> m lên đến nóc nhà vòm.<br>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> là điểm cách chân tường <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>5</mn></semantics></math> m. Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Khoảng cách từ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> đến nóc nhà vòm theo phương thẳng đứng là đoạn <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Thay <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math> vào phương trình elip, ta được <div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mn>64</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\t\tVậy khoảng cách cần tìm là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>93</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (m).</li></ol></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/97497e9114de1987b8525a2e862880d80ab4b0072bee8925f6634da475cbf690.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
